      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "H9 admanage builds an ID→name reverse map so ad sets with a direct campaignId still land in .admanage-state/campaigns.json (PR #204, previously they were created in AdManage but not in state, leading to duplicate provisioning on the next run)"
